es and contribute to the continued growth of the […] Lab Assistant Lab Assistant Master of Science in Occupational Therapy, Bert Bradford School of Health Sciences, University of Charleston Position Summary: This position serves as the Master of Science in Occupational Therapy (MSOT) Lab […] Assistant or Associate Professor,  Doctor of Executive Leadership Program School of Leadership, University of Charleston Position Summary: This graduate faculty member will facilitate courses in the Doctor of Executive (DEL) program, participate in faculty governance, be active in program recruitment, […] Administrative Assistant (Part-Time) Administrative Assistant (Part-Time) Provost Office, University of Charleston Position Summary: The Administrative Assistant to the Provost is a half-time (20 hours/week), 12-month administrative position reporting directly to the Provost. The staff […] Physics Adjunct – Department of Natural Sciences Physics Adjunct – Department of Natural Sciences School of Arts & Sciences, University of Charleston Position Summary: The Department of Natural Sciences at the University of Charleston, Charleston, WV, invites applications […] Student Engagement & Retention Coordinator Student Engagement & Retention Coordinator Title III University of Charleston   Position Summary: The Title III Student Success Coordinator plays a critical role in supporting student persistence, engagement, and degree […] Posts pagination 1 2 3 » Explore Programs Give Request Info Visit Apply 2300 MacCorkle Ave SE Charleston, WV 25304 1-800-995-4682 (GO UC) Contact Us Giving Visiting Campus Campus Safety and Security myUC Privacy Policy Consumer Information and Disclosures Campus Directory Employment News Events Bookstore Title IX Support UC Unlock a world of limitless opportunity for our students. Make a Gift © 2026 University of Charleston Instagram Twitter Facebook Youtube LinkedIn"
